{"title":"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 24","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The measure of angle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/8/46853828ad371bf8327abee8d74f620270c06b75.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50^\\circ$\" width=\"24\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/b/cfbb4c52e011ceed6e813118a7d59e931af444a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AD}$\" width=\"29\" height=\"15\" /> bisects angle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/d/2edcdc0d73ef64ec441f60a3a8dccdbd10aa61a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BAC$\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/b/63b7e5ec2db31e9aded4bb09881b42d1c439fce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{DC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" /> bisects angle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/a/eea6d74b22c9c0c032d83f29d6483eaf1a635183.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BCA$\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" />.  The measure of angle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/0/840cb55c82434b9ae047760636a017e9441e6ca5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ADC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/c/b8c508ab617894b8e5319d685f1b7a1a01defa24.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] pair A,B,C,D; A = (0,0); B = (9,10); C = (10,0); D = (6.66,3); dot(A); dot(B); dot(C); dot(D); draw(A--B--C--cycle); draw(A--D--C);  label(&quot;$A$&quot;,A,SW); label(&quot;$B$&quot;,B,N); label(&quot;$C$&quot;,C,SE); label(&quot;$D$&quot;,D,N); label(&quot;$50^\\circ $&quot;,(9.4,8.8),SW); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"252\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/f/6ef71dcc18fd8030501cc0e6a14deb14b779e210.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 90^\\circ \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 100^\\circ \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 115^\\circ \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 122.5^\\circ \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 125^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"463\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/b/efb236687cef9873ca9f13a0821c70bdf55322c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle CAD = \\angle BAD = x$\" width=\"171\" height=\"13\" />, and let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/2/9921298e766345079eb5f8f967723b4f4d9b6636.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ACD = \\angle BCD = y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"171\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>From <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" />, we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/7/1471c10ab09f6483c8dc7e2b534304d4b2022b9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50 + 2x + 2y = 180$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"151\" height=\"16\" />, leading to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/1/d2101867bc5fffe0ee9cfce1759c2bfafde1f4f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + y = 65$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>From <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/e/b8eabc87afe4c11a47e4aa27628d5517af4866b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ADC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" />, we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/7/3a7f2aacabcce3786a4c82afa32517ead35bc608.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + y + \\angle D = 180$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"143\" height=\"16\" />.  Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/1/d2101867bc5fffe0ee9cfce1759c2bfafde1f4f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + y = 65$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/d/2ad56f71c430703c9656eb4ca7a024e34988cd72.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle D = 180 - 65 = 115$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"171\" height=\"13\" />, which is answer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/5/3f58d2efaaa17d28cec9dd927d78708a63b43e24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Contruct <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/3/0f32db217d7630882c3441fa8821cd70a6958c3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{BE}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" /> through <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> and intersects <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/5/12517bbc31cb9026c71299b7a0d232d07e60f284.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" /> at point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>By Exterior Angle Theorem,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/2/d42cbff366cf8f7dafd8ea77bcd737f505fa4cb7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle{ADE}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"58\" height=\"14\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/e/d5eb8726a34932d28103ce7ce17456421222603f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"9\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/b/b8b5ff438eada9fdb4c33f8028107d97f63878b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle{ABD} + \\angle{BAD}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"138\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Similarly,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/4/254b912f0b22eec44a0d27245bf9da317ffd3dac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle{EDC} = \\angle{DBC} + \\angle{BCD}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"220\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Thus,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/0/9b0965413a2b93dd67e5622d3a138249314fecec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle{ADC} = \\angle{ABC} + \\angle{BAD} + \\angle{BCD}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"296\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/8/4c8f28ee0032712102db0b25261df2abd9d91a0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle{ADC} = x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"93\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/b/cfbb4c52e011ceed6e813118a7d59e931af444a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AD}$\" width=\"29\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/0/ce0bfc603f9a044e308b1a1fdadca917e81ad2dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{CD}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" /> are angle bisectors,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/7/46767715c72c659e752298c810013c2824dfde1f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} 180^\\circ - x &amp;= \\angle{BAD} + \\angle{BCD}\\\\ &amp;=x - 50^\\circ \\end{align*}\" width=\"226\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/3/623b030f5e29d675b1681ae2a6a560d8432d9b63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 115^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"71\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Thus, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/5/3f58d2efaaa17d28cec9dd927d78708a63b43e24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />\n</p><p>~ lovelearning999\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME\" title=\"1996 AJHSME\">1996 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1996\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 23\">Problem 23</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 25\">Problem 25</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"